#. module: website_blog
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:website_blog.blog_post_6
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<b>Binoculars are lightweight and portable.</b> Unless you have the luxury "
"to set up and operate an observatory from your deck, you are probably going "
"to travel to perform your viewings. Binoculars go with you much easier and "
"they are more lightweight to carry to the country and use while you are "
"there than a cumbersome telescope set up kit."
msgstr ""
"<b>Daljnogledi so lahki in prenosljivi.</b> Če nimate tega razkošja, da bi "
"lahko na svoji terasi postavili in upravljali observatorij, boste za "
"opazovanja verjetno morali potovati. Daljnogled boste veliko lažje vzeli s "
"seboj, poleg tega pa ga je lažje prenašati na podeželje in tam uporabljati "
"kot okoren komplet za postavitev teleskopa."

#. module: website_blog
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:website_blog.blog_post_6
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<b>Pick the brains of the experts</b>. If you are not already active in an "
"astronomy society or club, the sales people at the telescope store will be "
"able to guide you to the active societies in your area. Once you have "
"connections with people who have bought telescopes, you can get advice about "
"what works and what to avoid that is more valid than anything you will get "
"from a web article or a salesperson at Wal-Mart."
msgstr ""
"<b>Povprašajte strokovnjake</b>. Če še niste dejavni v astronomskem društvu "
"ali klubu, vas bodo prodajalci v trgovini s teleskopi lahko usmerili k "
"dejavnim društvom v vašem okolju. Ko navežete stike z ljudmi, ki so kupili "
"teleskope, lahko dobite nasvete o tem, kaj deluje in čemu se izogniti, ki so "
"bolj verodostojni kot vse, kar boste izvedeli iz spletnega članka ali od "
"prodajalca v trgovini Wal-Mart."

#. module: website_blog
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/website_blog/static/src/tours/website_blog.js:0
msgid "<b>Publish your blog post</b> to make it visible to your visitors."
msgstr "<b>Objavite svoj blog,</b> da bo viden vašim obiskovalcem."

#. module: website_blog
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_blog.opt_blog_post_comment
msgid "<b>Sign in</b>"
msgstr "<b>Prijava</b>"

#. module: website_blog
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:website_blog.blog_post_6
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<b>Try before you buy.</b> This is another advantage of going on some field "
"trips with the astronomy club. You can set aside some quality hours with "
"people who know telescopes and have their rigs set up to examine their "
"equipment, learn the key technical aspects, and try them out before you sink "
"money in your own set up."
msgstr ""
"<b>Preizkusite, preden kupite.</b> To je še ena prednost udeleževanja "
"nekaterih terenskih izletov z astronomskim klubom. Z ljudmi, ki poznajo "
"teleskope in imajo svojo opremo že pripravljeno, si lahko vzamete nekaj "
"kakovostnih ur, da si ogledate njihovo opremo, se naučite ključnih tehničnih "
"vidikov in jo preizkusite, preden zapravite denar za lastno opremo."

#. module: website_blog
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/website_blog/static/src/tours/website_blog.js:0
msgid ""
"<b>Write your story here.</b> Use the top toolbar to style your text: add an "
"image or table, set bold or italic, etc. Drag and drop building blocks for "
"more graphical blogs."
msgstr ""
"<b>Tu napišite svojo zgodbo.</b> Uporabite zgornjo orodno vrstico za "
"oblikovanje besedila: dodajte sliko ali tabelo, nastavite krepko ali poševno "
"pisavo itd. Vlečite in spustite gradnike za več grafičnih blogov."

#. module: website_blog
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:website_blog.blog_post_1
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<em class=\"h4 my-0\">Apart from the native population, the local wildlife "
"is also a major crowd puller.</em>"
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"h4 my-0\">Poleg avtohtonega prebivalstva je lokalna divjad prav "
"tako velika atrakcija za obiskovalce.</em>"

#. module: website_blog
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:website_blog.blog_post_6
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<em class=\"h4 my-0\">It is critically important that you get just the right "
"telescope.</em>"
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"h4 my-0\">Izjemno pomembno je, da dobite ravno pravšnji "
"teleskop.</em>"

#. module: website_blog
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:website_blog.blog_post_4
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<em class=\"h4 my-0\">That “Wow” moment is what astrology is all about.</em>"
msgstr "<em class=\"h4 my-0\">Ta trenutek »Vau« je bistvo astrologije.</em>"

#. module: website_blog
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:website_blog.blog_post_3
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<em class=\"h4 my-0\">The more reviews you read, the more you notice how "
"they tend to cluster at the extremes of opinion.</em>"
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"h4 my-0\">Več mnenj kot preberete, bolj opažate, kako se "
"ponavadi kopičijo na skrajnih polih mnenj.</em>"

#. module: website_blog
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:website_blog.blog_post_5
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<em class=\"h4 my-0\">There is something timeless about the cosmos.</em>"
msgstr "<em class=\"h4 my-0\">V kozmosu je nekaj brezčasnega.</em>"

#. module: website_blog
#: model_terms:blog.post,content:website_blog.blog_post_7
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<em class=\"h4 my-0\">Your study of the moon, like anything else, can go "
"from the simple to the very complex.</em>"
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"h4 my-0\">Vaše preučevanje Lune, tako kot vse drugo, lahko sega "
"od preprostega do zelo zapletenega.</em>"

